  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support Vulnerable Conflict and Drought Displaced Communities through the Provision of WASH and SNFI Services</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of this project is to provide lifesaving support to conflict and drought affected communities in Somalia through the provision of integrated water, sanitation and hygiene services in Mataban district, Hiraan and emergency shelter and non-food items to displaced people in Bulo Burte district, Hiraan.</narrative>
  </description>
